{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "084b4201-286a-8edd-9517-0846c4a1d13c",
  "created_at": "2025-12-15T08:56:03-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Finance",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Raj Kim",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Luis Barros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T08:52:45-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Finance department, this is Luis. Happy Monday, sort of. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T08:52:50-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Morning. Sorry, I'm going to keep my voice low, I've got a baby on the bottle here. I have a parking ticket and I want to understand what happens if I don't pay it right away."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T08:53:03-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, I'll keep it down too. Do you have the ticket handy?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T08:53:08-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I do. It's from Friday, overnight parking on a street where, in my opinion, the sign is half hidden behind a branch. But that's another matter. The notice says the fine goes up if it's late. How much does it double to, and when does that happen?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T08:53:25-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So generally, if it isn't paid or appealed within the window printed on the ticket, the fine doubles. I don't want to quote you the wrong amount, so go by what's on the ticket. Look near the bottom, there should be a due date and a late amount."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T08:53:42-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, hold on. [pause] Yes. It says twenty-one days, then it doubles. Twenty-one days is generous, I'll give them that. Though the original amount is a lot for a sign nobody can see."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T08:53:54-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, so twenty-one days from the ticket date, then the double kicks in. Count from Friday, not from when you got around to reading it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T08:54:04-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fair enough. Now, if I appeal it, how long does that take? Because in my experience anything with a form takes forever."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T08:54:12-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's not instant. You file the appeal, a hearing officer looks at it, and you get a decision by mail. Usually a few weeks, depending on how busy they are. The appeal has to be in before that deadline, though."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T08:54:27-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A few weeks. Okay. Does the fine still double while it's pending, or is it frozen?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T08:54:33-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "As long as the appeal is filed on time, it's on hold. If you lose, you'll get a new date to pay."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T08:54:41-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good, that's sensible at least. One more thing. If I decide to just pay it, can I do it online tonight, after City Hall has closed? I'm up at all hours with this one, so evenings are when I get things done."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T08:54:56-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, there's online payment on the city website, and it works any hour. You'll need the ticket number off the notice. There's also a drop box at City Hall if you'd rather pay by check."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T08:55:09-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Online is fine. Is there a fee for paying that way? Seems like there's always some fee tacked on for the privilege."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T08:55:17-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There may be a processing charge from the payment company. It should show before you confirm, so you'll see it before you hit the button."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T08:55:26-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Good. And the ticket number is the one at the top, correct? There's a long one and a short one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T08:55:34-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The ticket number is the one labeled that, usually at the top. The longer one may be a citation or plate reference. If the site rejects one, try the other."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T08:55:45-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. I'm at one seventy-nine Bacheller Street if you need that for anything. Probably don't."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T08:55:51-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not for the online payment. You're all set. Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T08:55:55-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that covers it. Thanks for your help."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T08:55:59-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Good luck with the little one."
    }
  ],
